        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: आशीर्वाद",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आशीर्वाद (āśīrvād) — \"a blessing\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Sanskrit āśīr-vāda: āśis, 'a wish, a prayer', joined to vāda, 'speech'. A blessing is literally a wish said out loud. The s turning into r before the v is a regular joint in Sanskrit rather than a quirk of this one word."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It travels downward. An elder gives आशीर्वाद (āśīrvād); the younger person asks for it by bending to touch the elder's feet, and the giving is spoken over the bent head."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Four, and this one is given rather than said."
            }
          ]
        },
